  "question": {
    "text": "An electron of charge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi></math>&nbsp;is moving in a circular orbit of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;around a nucleus, at a frequency&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#965;</mi></math>. The&nbsp;magnetic moment associated with the orbital motion of the electron is"
  },
